  "text": "toolbox\nOverview\nStarters\nSkills\nAnimations\nSound & Art\nWorkshop\nEngine\nReference\nShapes\nMods\nGames\nPick a genre\nSound & Art\n\nNothing here is stock. Sounds, music, voices and pictures are made on request, in a shared style.\n\nSTYLE FAMILIES: ONE SQUARE, NINE WAYS, WITH A TRACK AND A SOUND EACH\nlowpoly-cozy\n▶ music▶ sound\npainterly-fantasy\n▶ music▶ sound\ntoon-vibrant\n▶ music▶ sound\nvoxel-bright\n▶ music▶ sound\nrealistic-gritty\n▶ music▶ sound\nscifi-neon\n▶ music▶ sound\ngothic-horror\n▶ music▶ sound\npixel-bright\n▶ music▶ sound\npixel-moody\n▶ music▶ sound\n\n■ stop the sample\n· music and sounds are made fresh from a name the first time, so a first press can take a few seconds.\n\nTOOLS\nSound by name\n\nAny effect or music track conjured from a name in a style family.\n\nVoiced lines\n\nCharacters speak any line, with direction like [sighs] or [whispers].\n\nPainted pictures\n\nIcons, portraits, posters, concept art, textures in seconds.\n\nCutouts\n\nAny picture's subject freed onto a transparent background.\n\nSeamless textures\n\nTiling materials for any surface, by name.\n\nBlender on hand\n\nHero models, bakes and renders built by helpers.\n\nWeb reads\n\nLive web pages and real map data (roads, rail) pulled into a game.\n\nAI text jobs\n\nBuilt-in language model calls for NPC talk, generated quests, judges.\n\ntoolbox · everything this world can build with",
